\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic version</a> of <a href=\"/page/Item:Wolf_Whistle\" title=\"Item:Wolf Whistle\">Wolf Whistle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Summon_Epic_Thaarak_Hound\" title=\"Summon Epic Thaarak Hound\">Summon Epic Thaarak Hound</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Summon_Epic_Thaarak_Hound\" title=\"Summon Epic Thaarak Hound\">Summon Epic Thaarak Hound</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 20<br /><b>Charges: </b>1 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 1 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heightened_Awareness\" title=\"Heightened Awareness\">Heightened Awareness 4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heightened_Awareness\" title=\"Heightened Awareness\">Heightened Awareness 4</a>:</b> This item helps you to quickly read situations with sharpness and clarity, allowing you to predict actions before they occur. You gain a +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to AC.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Listen\" title=\"Listen\">Listen +17</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Listen\" title=\"Listen\">Listen +17</a>:</b> Passive: +17 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Listen\" title=\"Listen\">Listen</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\"> Reflex Save +9</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\"> Reflex Save +9</a>:</b> This item gives a +9 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to your Reflex saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Proof_Against_Disease\" title=\"Proof Against Disease\"> Proof Against Disease +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Proof_Against_Disease\" title=\"Proof Against Disease\"> Proof Against Disease +8</a>:</b> This item grants its wearer immunity to natural diseases. This item also grants a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to saving throws against magical diseases, and the wearer does not fail saving throws against them on a roll of a natural 1 (this renders the wearer immune to magical diseases with a DC of less than 9 + their Fortitude save).</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment colorless\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Colorless Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Epic_Windlasher&#39;s_Ferocity\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Windlasher's Ferocity</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Epic_Windlasher&#39;s_Ferocity\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Windlasher's Ferocity</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+10% Artifact bonus to Doublestrike and Doubleshot<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Melee and Ranged Power</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Wolf_Whistle.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Wolf_Whistle.png/420px-Epic_Wolf_Whistle.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"657\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Wolf_Whistle.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Wolf_Whistle\" title=\"Item:Legendary Wolf Whistle\">Legendary Wolf Whistle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A molded metal whistle that can charm non-magical canine creatures with blasts of ultrasonic sound.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>The epic Thaarak Hound cannot be summoned in public areas.\n</p><p>Summons an extremely tough CR35 Epic <a href=\"/page/Thaarak_Hound\" title=\"Thaarak Hound\">Thaarak Hound</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Over 7000 hitpoints.</li>\n<li>Primarily a spell caster, with high spell DCs and maximize and empower. Spells cast:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Acid_Blast_(spell)\" title=\"Acid Blast (spell)\">Acid Blast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Cyclonic_Blast\" title=\"Cyclonic Blast\">Cyclonic Blast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Phantasmal_Killer\" title=\"Phantasmal Killer\">Phantasmal Killer</a> (Indirect through its Dance of Death, high enough DC to kill the odd epic monster)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Very poor melee ability. The rare times it does attack, it deals around ~90 damage and attacks very slowly.</li>\n<li>Uses stealth. Can be hard to tell if he's following you unless you carefully manually click him or have a high Spot skill.</li>\n<li>Has a duration of 5 minutes, half that of a standard summon.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817205924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.139 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4283/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33796/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12925/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n116.90%  132.271     59 Template:IO\n100.00%  113.150      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  113.150      1 -total\n 97.56%  110.386      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 38.42%   43.469      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 37.65%   42.596      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 36.85%   41.697      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 36.05%   40.793      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.84%   25.847     10 Template:Popup\n 14.77%   16.717      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10774-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817205924 and revision id 630596. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Epic Wolf Whistle\n  | minlevel                 = 20\n  | type                     = Necklace\n  | class                    = Jewelry\n  | slot                     = Neck\n  | durability               = 210\n  | hardness                 = 25\n  | material                 = Gold\n  | basevalue                = 8020pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|Bta|BoA}}\n  | revamped                 = Update 59\n  | epic                     = Wolf Whistle\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Clicky|Summon Epic Thaarak Hound|20|1}} \n* {{Heightened Awareness|4}} \n* {{Skills|Listen|17}}\n* {{Save|Reflex|9}}\n* {{Proof|Disease|8}}\n* {{Augment|Colorless}}\n* {{Augment|Green}}\n* {{Named item sets|Epic Windlasher's Ferocity}}\n  | crafting                 = Legendary Crafting\n  | craftingupgrade          = Legendary Wolf Whistle\n  | description              = A molded metal whistle that can charm non-magical canine creatures with blasts of ultrasonic sound.\n  | pic                      = Necklace Generic Blue.png\n  | picdesc                  = Epic Wolf Whistle.png\n  | tips                     = \nThe epic Thaarak Hound cannot be summoned in public areas.\n\nSummons an extremely tough CR35 Epic [[Thaarak Hound]].\n* Over 7000 hitpoints.\n* Primarily a spell caster, with high spell DCs and maximize and empower. Spells cast:\n** [[Acid Blast (spell)|Acid Blast]]\n** [[Cyclonic Blast]]\n** [[Phantasmal Killer]] (Indirect through its Dance of Death, high enough DC to kill the odd epic monster)\n* Very poor melee ability. The rare times it does attack, it deals around ~90 damage and attacks very slowly.\n* Uses stealth. Can be hard to tell if he's following you unless you carefully manually click him or have a high Spot skill.\n* Has a duration of 5 minutes, half that of a standard summon.\n}}\n[[Category:Sands of Menechtarun epic items]]\n[[Category:Summons]]",
